292 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 152 0 R/E(For value and quality-conscious Too Good To Go users who want greater transparency in their Surprise Bags, Too Good To Go comment section is a new addition to the platform that allows users to share their authentic experiences with a restaurant\220s Surprise Bags. Unlike Too Good To Go\220s current model that only posts a restaurant\220s general star ratings, Too Good To Go comment section encourages customers to clarify the gray area in their star ratings, answer other users\220 inquiries, and holds restaurants accountable to selling quality Surprise Bags.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

